{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"储能","country":"保加利亚","country_iso":"BGR","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:38:18.651620","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"BGR-ES-0004","ldc":"No","location":"Razlog","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"保加利亚55MWh储能项目","project_name_en":"Bulgaria 55MWh Energy Storage Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"pvmagC","content":"由Renalfa/SolarPro Holding安装的太阳能电池板。图片来源：Renalfa\nHithium和Solarpro宣布，他们将在保加利亚西南部城镇Razlog建造一个55 MWh的储能设施。工程将于明年开始动工。\n两家公司在昨天发布的新闻稿中声称，这将是东南欧“最大”的电池储能项目，该设施将支持现有的33 MWp太阳能发电厂。新闻稿并未透露现有33 MWp太阳能项目的所有者是谁。\n总部位于中国的储能公司Hithium将为这个55 MWh项目提供电池，而总部位于保加利亚的太阳能承包商Solarpro将提供工程承包、采购和施工（EPC）服务。\nHithium将提供16块3.44 MWh容量的储能电池。\n据新闻稿披露，总部位于维也纳的独立电力生产商Renalfa旗下一家未具名的公司，将成为该电池储能系统（BESS）的所有者。投资者决定将电池安装在现有33 MWp容量的光伏电站内部。\n该阵列将包括一个光伏追踪器安装系统和一个变电站。\n根据国际可再生能源署（IRENA）最近公布的统计数据，到2022年底，保加利亚的太阳能光伏装机容量为1,948 MW。上个月，保加利亚政府启动了首个可再生能源项目，预计将分配超过1,400 MW的发电容量和超过350 MW的储能容量。","content_sha256":"229044f0561b87ac11a31c051581fa60419b9a29c38df1c818910ab59693be67","id":10924,"publish_date":"2023-11-22 15:28:02","title":"Hithium和Solarpro将在保加利亚建造55MWh储能设施","title_sha256":"2d18ef2fe8a0a05eae1bf22a1ca689fef7d6641e5bd34d4f28ccc908ba3c79db","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/53617.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"BGR-ES-0004","capacity_details":"BESS: 55MWh","capacity_mw":55.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"55","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:38:18.651986","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"BGR-ES-0004-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://cn.hithium.com/solutions/cases/details/8.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"2024